# =============================================================================
# NOBLE BIM ASSET TOOLS - GIT IGNORE
# =============================================================================

# Node dependency install tree (lockfile is committed; install with npm ci)
node_modules/

# Python bytecode from the local server
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local runtime / user scratch (keep folder, ignore generated noise)
05__LocalUserData/**
!05__LocalUserData/.gitkeep

# Converted output written by the GLB exporter during local testing
60__AppTesting/__ConvertedOutput/**
!60__AppTesting/__ConvertedOutput/.gitkeep

# Test fixtures are licensed vendor downloads, kept locally only
60__AppTesting/__Fixtures/**
!60__AppTesting/__Fixtures/.gitkeep

# Source BIM assets are never committed - they are large, licensed vendor
# downloads. Drop them anywhere outside the repo and load them via the app.
*.rfa
*.rvt
*.ifc
*.step
*.stp
*.iges
*.igs

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DDC RVT2IFC converter - DELIBERATELY NOT COMMITTED. Two reasons:
#
#   1. LICENCE. It bundles LibXL, whose terms state redistribution is
#      "prohibited unless expressly permitted by the EULA", and Open Design
#      Alliance software under a separate agreement. Committing it to a
#      repository - public or private - would be redistributing it.
#
#   2. SIZE. 720 MB, of which 689 MB is the ODA SDK in datadrivenlibs,
#      including one 80 MB file. GitHub warns above 50 MB per file.
#
# Nothing breaks without it. Revit files still load and show their parameter
# schedule, thumbnail and version data; only conversion to geometry is
# unavailable, and the Convert button does not appear.
#
# To enable conversion on a machine, obtain the converter from
# DataDrivenConstruction and place it at:
#   04__Src__Dependencies__VersionLocked/04__Vendor__DdcRvt2Ifc__v18.1.0/
#     DDC_REVIT2IFC_CONVERTER/RVT2IFCconverter.exe
#
# The server checks that path first, then falls back to the studio copy under
# D:/02_CoreLib__SketchUp/30__Software__3dSoftware__Tools&Utils/
# Run Na__Setup__VerifyDependencies__.py to see which one was found.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
04__Src__Dependencies__VersionLocked/04__Vendor__DdcRvt2Ifc__v18.1.0/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.npm/
